{"3883470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SOR.OP: Dark Shades", "steam_appid": 3883470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/2d5fb5b857535d1fb356847bb10a9fdd.avif?t=1783354144\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOR.OP: Dark Shades by SNRCStudios is an extremely realistic multiplayer shooter that immerses you in intense PvP battles with stunning graphics and lifelike environments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every shadow, every explosion, and every weapon is crafted with utmost precision – for a visual experience that pulls you right into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience realistic ballistics, precise gunplay, and a vast arsenal of customizable weapons that make every shot count.<br><br><strong>EXTREME ACTION! </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/0374d9c9ae7a336792f40db29da60d0c.poster.avif?t=1783354144\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/0374d9c9ae7a336792f40db29da60d0c.webm?t=1783354144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/0374d9c9ae7a336792f40db29da60d0c.mp4?t=1783354144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight on over 25 richly detailed maps ranging from urban battlefields to open landscapes and military bases – each with unique tactical challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six thrilling game modes such as Team Deathmatch, Free For All, Domination, Skirmish, Gun Game, and a challenging Zombie mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>SOR.OP: Dark Shades demands skill, teamwork, and strategy – are you ready for the ultimate fight?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/2d5fb5b857535d1fb356847bb10a9fdd.avif?t=1783354144\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOR.OP: Dark Shades by SNRCStudios is an extremely realistic multiplayer shooter that immerses you in intense PvP battles with stunning graphics and lifelike environments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every shadow, every explosion, and every weapon is crafted with utmost precision – for a visual experience that pulls you right into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience realistic ballistics, precise gunplay, and a vast arsenal of customizable weapons that make every shot count.<br><br><strong>EXTREME ACTION! </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/0374d9c9ae7a336792f40db29da60d0c.poster.avif?t=1783354144\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/0374d9c9ae7a336792f40db29da60d0c.webm?t=1783354144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883470/extras/0374d9c9ae7a336792f40db29da60d0c.mp4?t=1783354144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight on over 25 richly detailed maps ranging from urban battlefields to open landscapes and military bases – each with unique tactical challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six thrilling game modes such as Team Deathmatch, Free For All, Domination, Skir